#: app/Lib/Settings.php:933
msgid ""
"Turn on your PayPal Connection to easily pay your affiliates.<br /> You can "
"find generate your API tokens in your"
msgstr ""
"Aktivieren Sie Ihre PayPal-Verbindung, um Ihre Partner einfach zu bezahlen."
"<br /> Sie können Ihre API-Tokens in Ihrem"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:948
msgid "PayPal Integration - Enable Live Mode"
msgstr "PayPal-Integration - Aktivieren des Live-Modus"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:953
msgid ""
"Use the LIVE PayPal account and credentials. Otherwise, the SANDBOX "
"credentials will be used."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie das LIVE PayPal-Konto und die Zugangsdaten. Andernfalls werden "
"die SANDBOX-Anmeldedaten verwendet."

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:959
msgid "PayPal API Client ID - Live"
msgstr "PayPal-API-Client-ID - Live"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:964
msgid ""
"Sets your PayPal Client ID API Credential used to connect to your PayPal "
